id=gxr_mvhevc_eye_fix
name=Galaxy XR MV-HEVC Eye Fix
version=0.3.4
versionCode=9
author=AngelDark92
description=Corrects the left/right eye inversion Samsung Gallery XR shows for MV-HEVC spatial videos. The patched copies of libstagefright.so and libaplayer.so are generated on the device from the installed stock libraries (hash-verified before and after patching) and bind-mounted over them: the primary-eye computation is corrected from inverted (left-primary files report 2, right) to correct (report 1, left), and the value SemMediaPlayer reports to the app is forced to 1. Gallery XR then keeps its MULTIVIEW_LEFT_PRIMARY surface instead of switching to MULTIVIEW_RIGHT_PRIMARY and swapping the eyes. No vendor binaries ship in the package. No boot image or partition changes, no telemetry, no network use. Ships disabled; action.sh off, unticking the module (its watcher reverts within seconds), or deleting the module restores the stock libraries, and a reboot always does.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4uva4ek/galaxyxr-modules/main/updates/mvhevc-eye-fix.json
